json5/string
description: String in either the JSON spelling or the eigen JSON5 one
- >
  A JSON5 string is written in either of two spellings — the JSON one or the eigen JSON5 one:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  "json spelling"   'json5 spelling'
- >
  See the subchapters below for the two spellings:
- *..:..:..:07-json_code:01-json_scalar:00-json_string
- *: 01-json5_eigen_string
